  "scope": "One YAML 1.2 document from local bytes as a typed tree on the two schema-neutral valid controls. The rapidyaml C++ parse engine scans and parses into its index-based tree and Tree.resolve() expands aliases; ryml keeps every scalar as untyped text with style flags and a plain-null flag, so the adapter types unquoted non-null scalars with the YAML 1.2 core-schema patterns (adapter-side typing, as in the C++ rapidyaml path). No tags, merge keys, multi-document streams or malformed input were tested.",
